WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-13 - The Vivarium
NOTE Artist: Crimson Node
NOTE Album: 2002: Crimson Node

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.200
[Instrumental Intro: Syncopated Worldbeat Drums, Fretless Bass & Synth Flute]

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:26.500
Open up the door to the heavy heat

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.834
A jungle canopy right above the street

00:00:31.134 --> 00:00:34.200
The acrylic highway running on the wall

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.000
Watching the isopods never take a fall

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.800
Two hundred gallons in the basin below

00:00:40.852 --> 00:00:44.000
Keeping the rhythm of the water flow

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.815
We built an ecosystem, perfectly contained

00:00:47.915 --> 00:00:50.756
A strictly regulated climate where the chaos is chained

00:00:51.056 --> 00:00:54.478
But we have a single rule for the sanctuary space

00:00:54.538 --> 00:00:58.200
A non-negotiable boundary for the human race

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.881
No serpents in the garden! No snakes in the tree!

00:01:01.941 --> 00:01:06.424
The VIP has a boundary, and we guarantee!

00:01:06.504 --> 00:01:09.347
You can ask the insurance if you want to know why

00:01:09.427 --> 00:01:12.911
But the perimeter is locked and the limits apply!

00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:16.595
Welcome to the Vivarium!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:23.928
(Watch your step!)

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.500
